      "title": "Sentinel-observable physiologically meaningful early-warning signature established",
      "due_month": 12,
      "verifiable_criterion": "A hyperspectral physiological stress signature is demonstrated to be reproducible in Sentinel-resampled spectral space, evidenced by a validated hyperspectral-to-Sentinel feature mapping with quantified spectral agreement on concurrent observations.",
